msgstr "预期规模：350 小时"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:38
#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:49
#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:71 411eb24dabe6432aacf62fc80ec35526
