msgid "Level of Difficulty: Hard"
msgstr "难度等级：困难"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:39 7952680bc3244fa3bedb6be988f06263
msgid ""
"Expected Outcome: A toolchain that auto-builds or tunes SITL airframe models"
" from real flight logs"
msgstr "预期成果：一套能从真实飞行日志自动构建或调校 SITL 机体模型的工具链"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:41 f2c2a80a54af400ba8b861467dfecf66
msgid ""
"The goal of this project is to take ArduPilot logs and estimate the key "
"dynamics/sensor parameters needed for SITL, then output an updated model + "
"params that better match the real vehicle."
msgstr "本项目的目标是利用 ArduPilot 日志估计 SITL 所需的关键动力学/传感器参数，然后输出更贴合真实飞行器的更新模型和参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:46 876e6c7ab373412c91e302809c4a5473
msgid "Skills required: Networking, C/C++, Linux, MAVLink"
msgstr "所需技能：网络、C/C++、Linux、MAVLink"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:50 c41f926d472e4fe89739076c82b9bbaf
msgid ""
"Expected Outcome: A practical mesh networking layer for multi-vehicle comms "
"(telemetry + coordination)"
msgstr "预期成果：一个用于多飞行器通信（数传 + 协调）的实用 mesh 组网层"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:52 ae3a2b66733c488c8dc80cddb5a7783c
msgid ""
"The goal of this project is to enable resilient multi-hop links between "
"multiple ArduPilot vehicles, so telemetry and commands can route through the"
" swarm when direct links drop."
msgstr "本项目的目标是在多台 ArduPilot 飞行器之间实现有弹性的多跳链路，使数传和指令在直接链路中断时仍能通过集群路由传输。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:57 08ca397fba3142adb50eab4629f413e1
msgid ""
"Skills required: C++, control, servo systems, simulation (Gazebo/Ignition)"
msgstr "所需技能：C++、控制、舵机系统、仿真（Gazebo/Ignition）"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:59
#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:81 2214112652c5497dad681ef8168734b1
#: 74ca49cb179346a6a5afea3796b0e41c
msgid "Expected Size: 175h"
msgstr "预期规模：175 小时"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:60
#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:82 38bf768a6eb14ef792d6a03b7c9b25bb
#: f760b338cfb5425aab40f8d44bbfefe2
msgid "Level of Difficulty: Medium"
msgstr "难度等级：中等"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:61 17f1b1fb216f4c90b7500eedef7ea99a
msgid ""
"Expected Outcome: A minimal humanoid \"vehicle type\" running on ArduPilot "
"with SITL support"
msgstr "预期成果：一种运行在 ArduPilot 上并支持 SITL 的最小化人形“载具类型”"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:63 eb29aa7de66c458092601da7475cc1f7
msgid ""
"The goal of this project is to prove ArduPilot can command a small humanoid-"
"style jointed frame (think \"servo robot\"), with a basic control interface "
"and a simple simulated model."
msgstr "本项目的目标是证明 ArduPilot 能够控制一个小型人形关节机架（可理解为“舵机机器人”），并提供基础控制接口和简单的仿真模型。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:68 bdc9ae65c6194e249a43133841beea56
msgid ""
"Skills required: Python, ML (classification + retrieval), ArduPilot "
"logs/parameters"
msgstr "所需技能：Python、机器学习（分类 + 检索）、ArduPilot 日志/参数"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:72 1e96fb784d42456e8123c66bf1a77f53
msgid ""
"Expected Outcome: A model/service that flags likely root causes from logs "
"and suggests fixes with confidence"
msgstr "预期成果：一个能从日志中标记可能根因并给出带置信度修复建议的模型/服务"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:74 07fa9d2f1d5f4baeb5f2123c6ff31653
msgid ""
"The goal of this project is to automatically diagnose common failures and "
"misconfigurations by learning from labeled log segments, known issue "
"patterns, and parameter states. It should output a probable root cause, "
"suggested fixes, and a confidence score (with links to the relevant evidence"
" in the log)."
msgstr ""
"本项目的目标是通过学习带标注的日志片段、已知问题模式和参数状态，自动诊断常见故障与配置错误。它应输出可能的根因、修复建议和置信度评分（并附上日志中相关证据的链接）。"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:79 5ff182e484284564b87921b45da7899a
msgid "Skills required: C/C++ or Python, MAVLink, Linux companion computers"
msgstr "所需技能：C/C++ 或 Python、MAVLink、Linux 协同计算机"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:80 ee6af811bd9b42f085503cf1dcb8fc0f
msgid "Mentors: Jaime Machuca"
msgstr "导师：Jaime Machuca"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:83 b33710e0c15243aa8e48974e6a0ac8f6
msgid ""
"Expected Outcome: A standard MAVLink-based health reporting + failsafe "
"mechanism for companion computers"
msgstr "预期成果：一套基于 MAVLink 的标准协同计算机健康报告 + 失控保护机制"

#: ../../source/docs/gsoc-ideas-list.rst:85 2f922c43f7344c0ba3ad8969155af8b4
msgid ""
"The goal of this project is to define and implement a consistent \"companion"
" health\" report (CPU/GPU load, heartbeat, critical services, watchdog) and "
"connect it to configurable failsafes so ArduPilot can respond predictably "
"when the companion degrades or dies."
msgstr ""
"本项目的目标是定义并实现一致的“协同计算机健康”报告（CPU/GPU 负载、心跳、关键服务、看门狗），并将其与可配置的失控保护关联，使 "
"ArduPilot 在协同计算机性能下降或失效时能够可预测地响应。"

